          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "8.1.2 SI unit of time"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.524,
            0.743,
            0.562
          ],
          "content": "The **SI unit of time** is the **second**. Its **symbol** is s. The larger units of time are **minute** (**min**) and **hour** (h)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.274,
            0.575,
            0.386,
            0.593
          ],
          "content": "60 s = 1 min"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.46,
            0.575,
            0.571,
            0.593
          ],
          "content": "60 min = 1 h"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.942,
            0.051,
            0.987,
            0.069
          ],
          "content": "111"
        },
        {
